{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jack had a bag of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aed56990dedba5a88a65e21245ccfd5d5e43ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> apples.  He sold <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of them to Jill.  Next he sold <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of those remaining to June.  Of those apples still in his bag, he gave the shiniest one to his teacher.  How many apples did Jack have then?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a0b1c1b81680485a01dc0bc0ab9af17c3cf8fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 63 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 65 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 71 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 111$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After selling apples to Jill, Jack has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/024e5036d74bcff02645be03ab3b0ebd817a2b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.75 \\cdot 128 = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" /> apples left.  After selling apples to June, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/7/a87adbc15b97a4b8f8a71a615b1572745a5919e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.75 \\cdot 96 = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" /> apples left.  After giving an apple to his teacher, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299a71b1ad201d9c4367ab05b42106359ee0bd80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 - 1 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 71}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" /> apples left.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/i